<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>四级考试时间/流程</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'PingFang SC', sans-serif;
            background-color: #fdfdfd;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(#e8e8e8 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, #e8e8e8 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            color: #111;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .header-wrapper {
            background-color: #fbd49b;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            box-shadow: 2px 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .header-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #1a3c8a;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 
                -2px -2px 0 #fff,  
                 2px -2px 0 #fff,
                -2px  2px 0 #fff,
                 2px  2px 0 #fff,
                 3px  3px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .table-wrapper {
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 5px;
            box-shadow: 2px 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        table {
            border-collapse: collapse;
            width: 100%;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #c4e5e7;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .text-red {
            color: #d32f2f;
        }

        .content-container {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: stretch;
            padding: 0 10px;
        }

        .column {
            width: 46%;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .column p {
            margin: 3px 0;
        }

        .highlight-yellow {
            background-color: #ffff00;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 0 4px;
        }

        .highlight-cyan {
            background-color: #00ffff;
            padding: 0 2px;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 2px;
            background-color: #333;
            position: relative;
            margin: 15px 20px;
        }

        .divider::before, .divider::after {
            content: "◆";
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .divider::before {
            top: -8px;
        }

        .divider::after {
            bottom: -8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="header-wrapper">
        <h1 class="header-title">一、四级考试时间/流程</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>试卷结构</th>
                <th>测试内容</th>
                <th>测试题型</th>
                <th>分值占比</th>
                <th>考试时长</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>作文</td>
                <td>作文</td>
                <td>短文写作</td>
                <td>15%</td>
                <td class="text-red">30分钟</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td rowspan="3">听力</td>
                <td>短篇新闻3段</td>
                <td>选择题(单选)</td>
                <td>7%</td>
                <td rowspan="3" class="text-red">25分钟</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>长对话2篇</td>
                <td>选择题(单选)</td>
                <td>8%</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>听力篇章3篇</td>
                <td>选择题(单选)</td>
                <td>20%</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td rowspan="3">阅读理解</td>
                <td>词汇理解</td>
                <td>选词填空</td>
                <td>5%</td>
                <td rowspan="3" class="text-red">40分钟</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>长篇阅读</td>
                <td>匹配</td>
                <td>10%</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>仔细阅读</td>
                <td>选择题(单选)</td>
                <td>20%</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>翻译</td>
                <td>汉译英</td>
                <td>段落翻译</td>
                <td>15%</td>
                <td class="text-red">30分钟</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td colspan="3">总计</td>
                <td>100%</td>
                <td class="text-red">125分钟</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="column">
            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 8:40 考生入场</span></p>
            <p>1. 出示准考证、身份证、学生证。</p>
            <p>2. 手机严禁带入考场。</p>
            <p>3. 入座后请调试耳机试听。</p>
            <p>①证件不齐者严禁入场，不能参加考试。</p>
            <p>②核对好听力频率，开考后不再试听。</p>

            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 9:00 下发考试材料</span></p>
            <p>1. 检查试题册、条形码、答题卡的印刷质量。</p>
            <p>2. 阅读试题册正面“敬告考生”内容。</p>
            <p>3. 粘贴条形码、填写个人信息。</p>
            <p>①非听力考试期间不得佩戴耳机<br>且不得提前翻阅试题册，违规处理。</p>
            <p>②作文题目在试题册背面，<br>使用黑色签字笔在<span class="highlight-cyan">答题卡 1</span>上作答。</p>

            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 9:10 考试正式开始</span></p>
            <p>开始作答作文。30分钟。<br>之后将立即进行听力考试。</p>

            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 9:35 提示考生</span></p>
            <p>继续作答。<br>监考老师口头提醒，5分钟后开始听力考试。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="column">
            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 9:40 听力考试开始</span></p>
            <p>1. 打开试题册，戴上耳机。</p>
            <p>2. 进行听力考试。</p>
            <p>听力考试时间为25分钟，</p>
            <p>请考生掌握好答题卡1的填涂时间，</p>
            <p><span class="highlight-cyan">听力录音播放完毕后，将立即回收答题卡 1。</span></p>

            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 10:05 听力考试结束</span></p>
            <p>停止作答，摘下耳机。</p>
            <p>考试暂停5分钟，等待收答题卡 1。</p>

            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 10:10 命令考生继续作答</span></p>
            <p>作答阅读理解和翻译部分。</p>
            <p>监考老师口头提醒。</p>

            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 11:10 提示考生</span></p>
            <p>继续作答，掌握好时间。</p>
            <p>监考老师口头提醒，10分钟后考试将结束。</p>

            <p><span class="highlight-yellow">● 11:20 考试结束</span></p>
            <p>考生停止作答。</p>
            <p>①考生交回试题册、答题卡 2.</p>
            <p>②监考老师清点无误后考生方可离场。</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```
